  "description": "High Tech Frame\n\nH200 Plus has a high quality ultralight aluminium frame for easy riding and moving, corrosion resistant and very easy to clean and maintain\n\nVersatile 18-Speed Drivetain\n\nEquipped with a 18-speed drivetrain, adult bikes offer a variety of speed options for a flexible riding experience. Easily adjust the gears to suit your preference\n\nDurable XC Tires\n\nThe double-walled allow rim is stronger; The 26\" 27.5\" XC tire is not only thin and fast rolling, but also non-slip and wear resistant, has strong grip and puncture resistance for better stability on hills, gravel and trails\n\nSmooth City Commutes\n\nThis adult mountain bike is your reliable companion, ideal for relaxed city commutes and enjoyable rides on easy trails. It transitions seamlessly between city streets and scenic trails\n\nChoose Ideal Size\n\nTailored for both men and women, the 26\" adult mountain bike fits riders between 5’-6’, while the 27.5\" bike fits riders between 5’8’’-6’2’’\n\nMaster any trail with the Hiland H200 Plus Mountain Bike. Featuring a lightweight aluminum frame, 21-speed drivetrain, and stylish 3-spoke wheels. Shop now for the ultimate ride!",
